    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-packed third-person shooter with stunning visuals and high performance. A secret scientist organization summons you for a mysterious mission; rescue captives and uncover the truth behind a cataclysmic event. But beyond the portal doors lies an unknown fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beyond the portal doors lies an unknown fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Black State</i>, you'll have to stay sharp. As you search for the captives and piece together what really happened, you'll face relentless threats, hostile human forces and deadly Robosapien enemies patrol every corner. And the bosses? They\u2019re beyond anything you\u2019ve ever faced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step carefully, every door you open could lead to salvation or straight into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to open them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Portal Doors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/94c3cea91decb165195576d061002b48.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/94c3cea91decb165195576d061002b48.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/94c3cea91decb165195576d061002b48.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Black State, some doors don\u2019t just lead to another room. They open into entirely different locations instantly. No loading. No waiting. Just pure, seamless portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to pass through these portals to rescue captives and uncover the truth. Every portal door is a risk, a shortcut to completing your mission, or a trap. You won\u2019t know until you open it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will your next step take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Tactical Gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/f4c23a9a42dfe140db8993b0817127ff.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/f4c23a9a42dfe140db8993b0817127ff.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/f4c23a9a42dfe140db8993b0817127ff.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the Black State depends on how well you wield your weapons and gadgets. Pistols and rifles keep you steady, while a shotgun tears enemies apart at close range in a single blast. The fusion gun? Handle with care, its sheer power paints the walls with blood. And you haven\u2019t seen everything yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tactical gadgets can turn the tide, whether you take a stealthy approach or unleash total chaos. Just look at your target, throw, and let them do the work. But choose wisely, not every gadget is effective against all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When time slows down, every move matters. Think fast, act smart, and stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Close Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/4fb5368e7cf9e9862f3c46f7c9da3a14.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/4fb5368e7cf9e9862f3c46f7c9da3a14.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/4fb5368e7cf9e9862f3c46f7c9da3a14.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human and Robosapien soldiers are relentless hunters, built to corner and overwhelm you. Hiding won\u2019t save you, they\u2019ll flank, adapt, and call reinforcements if needed. And for some, bullets won\u2019t be enough to stop them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underestimate them, and you won\u2019t live to regret it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fight gets up close, you have over 110 brutal takedowns at your disposal. These executions adapt to your surroundings, whether striking from cover for a silent kill or finishing an enemy mid-fight, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/90f2208f20ec543114cc0aaf6cc82940.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/90f2208f20ec543114cc0aaf6cc82940.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/90f2208f20ec543114cc0aaf6cc82940.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has their own unique style and attack patterns. You must learn and adapt. Do not be fooled, you can\u2019t defeat them like regular enemies or even previous boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one possesses different abilities that force you to change your strategy. Some bosses won\u2019t let you get close, while others won\u2019t give you a chance to keep your distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt or fall. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Depths of Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/d1c625de959db2aba64802c4efb10c89.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/d1c625de959db2aba64802c4efb10c89.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/d1c625de959db2aba64802c4efb10c89.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black State pulls you into a deep, mysterious, and emotional journey where nothing is as it seems. Every step uncovers new secrets, every encounter shapes your path. Some doors lead to new mysteries, while others reveal the answers you seek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question is, are you ready to enter?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-packed third-person shooter with stunning visuals and high performance. A secret scientist organization summons you for a mysterious mission; rescue captives and uncover the truth behind a cataclysmic event. But beyond the portal doors lies an unknown fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beyond the portal doors lies an unknown fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Black State</i>, you'll have to stay sharp. As you search for the captives and piece together what really happened, you'll face relentless threats, hostile human forces and deadly Robosapien enemies patrol every corner. And the bosses? They\u2019re beyond anything you\u2019ve ever faced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step carefully, every door you open could lead to salvation or straight into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to open them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Portal Doors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/94c3cea91decb165195576d061002b48.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/94c3cea91decb165195576d061002b48.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/94c3cea91decb165195576d061002b48.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Black State, some doors don\u2019t just lead to another room. They open into entirely different locations instantly. No loading. No waiting. Just pure, seamless portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to pass through these portals to rescue captives and uncover the truth. Every portal door is a risk, a shortcut to completing your mission, or a trap. You won\u2019t know until you open it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will your next step take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Tactical Gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/f4c23a9a42dfe140db8993b0817127ff.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/f4c23a9a42dfe140db8993b0817127ff.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/f4c23a9a42dfe140db8993b0817127ff.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the Black State depends on how well you wield your weapons and gadgets. Pistols and rifles keep you steady, while a shotgun tears enemies apart at close range in a single blast. The fusion gun? Handle with care, its sheer power paints the walls with blood. And you haven\u2019t seen everything yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tactical gadgets can turn the tide, whether you take a stealthy approach or unleash total chaos. Just look at your target, throw, and let them do the work. But choose wisely, not every gadget is effective against all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When time slows down, every move matters. Think fast, act smart, and stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Close Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/4fb5368e7cf9e9862f3c46f7c9da3a14.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/4fb5368e7cf9e9862f3c46f7c9da3a14.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/4fb5368e7cf9e9862f3c46f7c9da3a14.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human and Robosapien soldiers are relentless hunters, built to corner and overwhelm you. Hiding won\u2019t save you, they\u2019ll flank, adapt, and call reinforcements if needed. And for some, bullets won\u2019t be enough to stop them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underestimate them, and you won\u2019t live to regret it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fight gets up close, you have over 110 brutal takedowns at your disposal. These executions adapt to your surroundings, whether striking from cover for a silent kill or finishing an enemy mid-fight, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/90f2208f20ec543114cc0aaf6cc82940.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/90f2208f20ec543114cc0aaf6cc82940.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/90f2208f20ec543114cc0aaf6cc82940.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has their own unique style and attack patterns. You must learn and adapt. Do not be fooled, you can\u2019t defeat them like regular enemies or even previous boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one possesses different abilities that force you to change your strategy. Some bosses won\u2019t let you get close, while others won\u2019t give you a chance to keep your distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt or fall. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Depths of Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/d1c625de959db2aba64802c4efb10c89.poster.avif?t=1740751034\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/d1c625de959db2aba64802c4efb10c89.webm?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/d1c625de959db2aba64802c4efb10c89.mp4?t=1740751034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black State pulls you into a deep, mysterious, and emotional journey where nothing is as it seems. Every step uncovers new secrets, every encounter shapes your path. Some doors lead to new mysteries, while others reveal the answers you seek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question is, are you ready to enter?</p>",
